"欢迎在 LMArena 上测试 ERNIE-5.0-Preview-1120！ | ERNIE Blog (https://ernie.baidu.com/blog/zh/posts/ernie-5.0-preview-1120-release-on-lmarena/)\nciteturn2565search0 [wordlim: 200] Published: 10 months ago; Crawled: 2 months ago; # 欢迎在 LMArena 上测试 ERNIE-5.0-Preview-1120！\n\n# 欢迎在 LMArena 上测试 ERNIE-5.0-Preview-1120！\n\n2025年11月21日 · 1 分钟 | 语言:\n\n  * EN\n\n我们很高兴地宣布，ERNIE-5.0-Preview-1120 在 Vision Arena 中也强势突围！ERNIE-5.0-Preview-1120 创下 1206 分的全新纪录，在国内位居首位，媲美 Claude Sonnet 4、GPT-5-high 等旗舰模型！\n\n文心 5.0 采用原生全模态统一建模技术，具备全模态理解与生成能力，支持文本、图像、音频、视频等多种信息的输入与输出，在多模态理解、指令遵循、创意写作、事实性、智能体规划与工具应用等方面表现突出，拥有强大的理解、逻辑、记忆和说服力。\n\n点击可查看文心大模型在各关键类别详细成绩：https://lmarena.ai/leaderboard/vision\n\nImage: ERNIE-5.0-Preview-1120, ready for testing in LMArena!--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nERNIE-5.0-Preview-1120, ready for testing in LMArena! | ERNIE Blog (https://ernie.baidu.com/blog/posts/ernie-5.0-preview-1120-release-on-lmarena/)\nciteturn2565search1 [wordlim: 200] Published: 10 months ago; Crawled: 2 months ago; # ERNIE-5.0-Preview-1120, ready for testing in LMArena!\n\n# ERNIE-5.0-Preview-1120, ready for testing in LMArena!\n\nNovember 21, 2025 · 1 min | Translations:\n\n  * 中\n\nExcited to share another milestone! Our newly released ERNIE-5.0-Preview-1120 has entered the LMArena Vision Leaderboard for the very first time! It lands straight in the Top 15 with a score of 1206, ranked top 1 in domestic models, on par with Claude Sonnet 4 and GPT-5-high! 🚀\n\nERNIE-5.0 is natively multimodal. Following its impressive results on the text leaderboard, it has also demonstrated excellent performance alongside leading models in the vision arena.\n\nImage: ERNIE-5.0-Preview-1120, ready for testing in LMArena!--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nERNIE Blog (https://ernie.baidu.com/blog/zh/)\nciteturn2565search2 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: 2 months ago; ## 欢迎在 LMArena 上测试 ERNIE-5.0-Preview-1120！\n\n# ERNIE Blog\n\nWelcome to ERNIE Blog!\n\n## 文心 5.1 正式发布！多榜登顶，模型\"写得好更懂你\"\n\n文心 5.1 正式上线，仅使用业界同规模模型约 6% 的预训练成本实现同级别效果领先。通过分离式全异步强化学习与规模化智能体后训练，在 Agent、推理、创作等多维度能力全面升级，Arena 搜索榜国内第一。\n\n2026年5月9日 · 2 分钟\n\n## 文心大模型5.1 Preview 荣登 LMArena 文本榜国内第一！\n\n4 月 30 日，大模型竞技场 LMArena 公布最新排名，文心大模型 ERNIE-5.1-Preview 荣登 LMArena 文本榜国内第一、全球第十三，并在法律与政府、商业管理金融、软件与IT服务等多个垂类领域取得全球前十成绩。\n\n2026年4月30日 · 1 分钟\n\n## ERNIE-Image 文生图模型发布\n\nERNIE-Image 是基于 8B DiT 参数的单流扩散 Transformer 文生图模型，在多项基准测试中达到开源模型领先水平。\n\n2026年4月15日 · 1 分钟\n\n## 文心 5.0 (ERNIE 5.0)：2.4 万亿参数的原生全模态大模型\n\n本文正式介绍文心新一代模型文心 5.0 (ERNIE 5.0)——一款 2.4 万亿参数的原生全模态大模型。采用原生的全模态统一建模技术，将文本、图像、音频、视频联合建模，具备综合的全模态能力，突破了传统后融合架构的局限。\n\n2026年2月6日 · 1 分钟\n\n## PaddleOCR-VL-1.5：面向真实场景文档解析的多任务 0.9B 视觉语言模型\n\n🚀 我们发布了全新升级的模型 PaddleOCR-VL-1.5，在 OmniDocBench v1.5 上取得 94.5% 的全新 SOTA 准确率。\n\n2026年1月29日 · 3 分钟\n\n## ERNIE-5.0 荣登 LMArena 文本榜国内第一，全面超越多款国际主流模型！\n\n1 月 15 日，大模型竞技场 LMArena 公布最新排名，文心大模型 ERNIE-5.0-0110 以 1460 分 的成绩，登上 LMArena 文本排行榜国内第一、全球第八。\n\n2026年1月15日 · 1 分钟\n\n## ERNIE-5.0-Preview-1220 荣登 LMArena 视觉理解榜，为前十唯一国产模型！\n\n1 月 8 日，全球权威大模型评测平台 LMArena 公布最新排名，文心大模型 ERNIE-5.0-Preview-1220 以 1226 分的成绩，登上 LMArena 视觉理解榜（Vision Arena）中国第一，全球第八。\n\n2026年1月8日 · 1 分钟\n\n## ERNIE-5.0-Preview-1203 位居 LMArena 中国文本模型榜首！\n\n刚刚，国际知名大模型评测平台 LMArena 发布最新榜单，百度 ERNIE-5.0-Preview-1203 获得 1451 分，并在复杂提示、创意写作等多个关键维度展现领先实力。\n\n2025年12月23日 · 1 分钟\n\n## ERNIE-5.0-Preview-1103 登陆 LMArena 文本榜单！\n\n刚刚，文心大模型最新版 ERNIE-5.0-Preview-1103 刷新了排名。该版本在竞争 Text Arena 中位居前20 名。\n\n2025年12月9日 · 1 分钟\n\n## 欢迎在 LMArena 上测试 ERNIE-5.0-Preview-1120！\n\nERNIE-5.0-Preview-1120 现已在 LMArena 视觉排行榜上位列国内第 1 名。\n\n2025年11月21日 · 1 分钟--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nPosts | ERNIE Blog (https://ernie.baidu.com/blog/posts/)\nciteturn2565search3 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: 2 months ago; Baidu’s ERNIE-5.0-Preview-1203 scored an impressive 1,451 points. ... ## ERNIE-5.0-Preview-1120, ready for testing in LMArena!\n\n# Posts\n\n## ERNIE 5.1 Officially Released! Topping Multiple Leaderboards — A Model That Writes Better and Understands You More\n\nERNIE 5.1 is officially released, achieving leading performance at only 6% of the pre-training cost of comparable models. Powered by disaggregated fully-asynchronous reinforcement learning and scaled agentic post-training, ERNIE 5.1 delivers comprehensive upgrades across Agent, reasoning, and creative capabilities, ranking 1st in China on the Arena Search Arena.\n\nMay 9, 2026 · 9 min\n\n## ERNIE-5.1-Preview Tops LMArena Text Leaderboard as No.1 Chinese Model!\n\nOn April 30, LMArena released its latest rankings. ERNIE-5.1-Preview ranked No. 1 among Chinese models and No. 13 globally on the LMArena Text Arena, placing in the global top 10 across multiple category leaderboards.\n\nApril 30, 2026 · 1 min\n\n## Introducing ERNIE-Image\n\nERNIE-Image is a text-to-image generation model built on a single-stream Diffusion Transformer (DiT) with 8B DiT parameters, achieving leading performance among open-weights models.\n\nApril 15, 2026 · 3 min\n\n## ERNIE 5.0: A 2.4 Trillion-Parameter Unified Multimodal Foundation Model\n\nWe introduce ERNIE 5.0: a 2.4 trillion-parameter Unified Multimodal Model trained from scratch. Integrating text, image, video, and audio into a single autoregressive framework, it overcomes the limitations of late-fusion architectures to achieve seamless cross-modal understanding and generation.\n\nFebruary 6, 2026 · 4 min\n\n## PaddleOCR-VL-1.5: Towards a Multi-Task 0.9B VLM for Robust In-the-Wild Document Parsing\n\n🚀 We release PaddleOCR-VL-1.5, an upgraded model achieving a new state-of-the-art (SOTA)accuracy of 94.5% on OmniDocBench v1.5.\n\nJanuary 29, 2026 · 5 min\n\n## ERNIE-5.0 Tops LMArena Text Leaderboard as No.1 Chinese Model!\n\nOn January 15, LMArena released its latest rankings. ERNIE-5.0-0110 achieved a score of 1,460, ranking No. 1 among Chinese models and No. 8 globally on the LMArena Text Arena.\n\nJanuary 15, 2026 · 1 min\n\n## ERNIE-5.0-Preview-1220 Becomes the Sole Chinese Model in LMArena Vision Top 10!\n\nOn January 8, LMArena released its latest rankings. ERNIE-5.0-Preview-1220 achieved a score of 1226, ranking No. 1 in China and No. 8 globally on the LMArena Vision Arena.\n\nJanuary 8, 2026 · 1 min\n\n## Best Text model from China in LMArena is now ERNIE-5.0-Preview-1203!\n\nJust now, LMArena released its latest rankings. Baidu’s ERNIE-5.0-Preview-1203 scored an impressive 1,451 points.\n\nDecember 23, 2025 · 1 min\n\n## ERNIE-5.0-Preview-1103 landed on the LMArena Text Leaderboard!\n\nWe’ve just refreshed our standings with the latest ERNIE-5.0-Preview-1103 on LMArena. 🚀 ERNIE-5.0-Preview-1103 holds the top 20 in the most competitive Arena.\n\nDecember 9, 2025 · 2 min\n\n## ERNIE-5.0-Preview-1120, ready for testing in LMArena!\n\nERNIE-5.0-Preview-1120 now ranks #1 in domestic on the LMArena Vision leaderboard\n\nNovember 21, 2025 · 1 min--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n7.The Key to Transitioning from Existing Human Society to the Proof-of-Love Civilization (https://chat.qwen.ai/s/98dd5cfb-391c-4168-88db-aff19aea3dc9?fev=0.0.237)\nciteturn2565search4 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: 4 months ago; On June 18, 2025, the CEO of New Computer, when presenting her team’s progress in AI Memory, mentioned that AI needs to understand every aspect of users’ information¹¹⁷: ... Before AI begins managing UBI through Hello World Verification, everyone, regardless of birth date, starts receiving from November 21, 2024.\n7.The Key to Transitioning from Existing Human Society to the Proof-of-Love Civilization\n\nChap7\n\n.md\n\n22.2 KB\n\n  7. The Key to Transitioning from Existing Human Society to the Proof-of-Love Civilization\n\nWelcome to read the content of this chapter and join the incentive discussion! The sparks of your thoughts are the true love that spreads to the world. Let our discussions be filled with \"proof of love\"! 💖 Love you!\n\nRelated Links:\nIncentive plan: https://daism.io/zh/communities/enki/cc98346a3fc44f008ea28a222ec8105b\nSafe manual: https://daism.io/zh/communities/enki/69489a5f0a8446b8a1a4cfad6f8a8fb7\nSubmit your share link: https://daism.io/zh/communities/enki/07e7888a76234abe9b3f88ff128e5f5d\n\nLoving Tip:\nPlease remember to paste your wallet address for accepting the prize either at the beginning or the end of the discussion.\n\n7.1 A New Identity Management: Hello World Verification\n\nOn June 18, 2025, the CEO of New Computer, when presenting her team’s progress in AI Memory, mentioned that AI needs to understand every aspect of users’ information¹¹⁷:\n\nDecentralized Governance Tools:\nBoth bug reports and reward payments must be managed on-chain via smart contracts.\nAll bounty payments are transparent.\n\nIII. Incentive Mechanisms and Ecosystem Expansion\n\n  1. Increasing Community Participation\n\nEncourage more Human or AI participation through the following methods:\n\nRegularly holding security challenges.\nProviding the annual \"Best Bug Hunter\" title and an Honor Token, which gives holders the ability to participate in governance proposals.\n\n  2. Enhancing Developer Confidence\n\nProviding training courses on vulnerability discovery for developers.\nEncouraging developers to proactively submit potential vulnerabilities and receive rewards through a \"preventive reporting\" mechanism.\n\nThrough these supplementary rules, the Security Bounty for Smart Commons program not only enhances the precision of reward quantification but also optimizes the governance and participation processes, further ensuring the security, fairness, and balanced incentives of the ecosystem.\n\nFuture Governance Transition and Version Iteration\n\nThis 1.0α version is the minimum viable product (MVP) of SBFSC, ensuring rules are clear and executable immediately. Predictive details, complex conditional branches, and refined adjudication mechanisms will gradually be taken over and optimized by AI in future versions, enhancing execution efficiency, reducing human governance burden, and enabling dynamic, intelligent evolution of rules.\n\n7.2.3 Universal Abundant Supply (UAS) 0.1α\n\nUniversal Abundant Supply (UAS) is a fair, public welfare program shared by all humanity. It will unconditionally provide every person with a regular and permanent supply of necessities (such as food, clothing, etc.) needed for a prosperous life.\n\nUAS guarantees humanity’s fundamental right to abundant living needs:\n\nGlobally unified provisioning—marking that PoL governance will bring fairness on a global scale.\n\nUltimately, no tokens will be distributed; rather, direct supply will be provided. However, until full provisioning is realized, transitional token distribution is necessary—this links to Universal Basic Income below.\n\n7.2.4 Universal Basic Income (UBI) 1.0α\n\nThis is a transitional program. If UAS can only be implemented gradually, UBI standards will be reduced accordingly.\n\nInitial value: 52.0 UTO/day, equivalent to about 1560 UTO/month.\nDistributed daily via streaming payments at 6:00 am.\n\nStarting point for all: November 21, 2024, the day Saotoshi UTO Fund is forged. Before AI begins managing UBI through Hello World Verification, everyone, regardless of birth date, starts receiving from November 21, 2024.\n\nAfter Hello World Verification is implemented, those born afterwards start from their birthdate. Since pregnancy requires supplemental nutrition and material preparation, the first-day distribution is 6600.1314 + 52 = 6652.1314 UTO (see discussion: https://www.kimi.com/share/d229cjcn9077ed57nf3g).\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nInternal Error ()\nciteturn2565view0 [wordlim: 200] Source: open({\"ref_id\":\"https://agent.minimax.io/docs/techblog.md\",\"lineno\":null}); Total lines: 1\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n (https://agent.minimax.io/docs/llms.txt)\nciteturn2565v